From 791ba28f51f0035331326af61c9c42c1f0fb448d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard DEMONGEOT <richard@rdem-systems.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:07:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/22] feat(machine): generate the PVE VM config from the real
 machine

"vm" disk snapshots carried a fixed qemu-server.conf template (4 cores,
2 GB, win11, BIOS, no NIC, random SMBIOS UUID, boot on sata0, rendered
with html/template), so a Proxmox VE restore produced a VM that often
did not boot (UEFI installs) or lost its identity.

CollectMachineInfo now probes the source machine (best-effort):
- Windows: RtlGetVersion + ProductName (Windows 11 fix-up) for the OS,
  GlobalMemoryStatusEx, GetFirmwareType, Secure Boot state (registry),
  TPM presence (Tbsi_GetDeviceInfo), SMBIOS type 1 via
  GetSystemFirmwareTable('RSMB'), system-drive disk via the volume
  extents already used for VSS.
- Linux: /etc/os-release, /proc/meminfo, /sys/firmware/efi + SecureBoot
  efivar, /sys/class/tpm, /sys/class/dmi/id, root filesystem disk via
  /sys/dev/block (following dm/LVM/md slaves).
- All: logical CPUs, physical NICs (virtual adapters filtered by name,
  locally administered MACs sorted last).

BuildQemuConfig renders cores, memory, bios: ovmf for UEFI, ostype from
the Windows version/edition (win11/win10/win8/win7/...) or l26, one
netN per adapter keeping its MAC (e1000e on Windows, virtio on Linux),
smbios1 with the real UUID and base64 strings, boot order on the system
disk, and description notes listing what to add before first boot (EFI
disk with pre-enrolled keys when Secure Boot was on, TPM state, Unique
MACs). efidisk0/tpmstate0 are not declared since the backup has no such
volume. Every machine backup also uploads machine-info.json.blob.

CI runs the new pure-Go tests through the machinebackup module.

Port onto upstream: keeps upstream's findings in the generated config,
a "#qmdump#map" line per disk (without it PVE restores no data),
cache=writeback, and bios: ovmf for a GPT boot disk even when firmware
detection fails. Replaces upstream's fixed template (renderQemuConfig).
